## 2. Definitions

For the purposes of this License:

**"Software"** means the software, source code, object code, documentation, configuration, scripts, and other copyrightable material that the copyright holder identifies as being released under this License.

**"Original Software"** means the Software as first released under this License by its copyright holder.

**"Modified Version"** means any version of the Software in which material has been added, removed, altered, translated, adapted, or otherwise changed in a manner that requires permission under applicable copyright law.

**"Derivative Work"** means a work based upon, incorporating, adapting, modifying, or otherwise containing a substantial portion of the Software in a manner that would require permission from the copyright holder under applicable copyright law.

**"Source Code"** means the preferred form of the Software for making modifications, including source files, build scripts, configuration files, interface definitions, and other files reasonably necessary to understand, modify, build, or reproduce the Software.

**"Object Code"** means any form of the Software that is not Source Code.

**"Distribute"** means to provide, sell, publish, transmit, sublicense, or otherwise make a copy of the Software or a Derivative Work available to another person or organization.

**"Contributor"** means a person or organization that has made a material copyrightable contribution to the Software or a Derivative Work and whose contribution is identified as such by the project or its copyright holders.

**"Attribution Record"** means the project's `AUTHORS`, `CONTRIBUTORS`, `NOTICE`, or equivalent record, together with copyright notices and other attribution information identifying persons or organizations that have contributed to the Software.

**"You"** means any person or organization exercising rights under this License.

