## 7. Modification Notices

If you Distribute a Modified Version, you must clearly indicate that the Software has been modified.

The indication must identify, where reasonably practical:

1. that modifications were made;
2. the date of the modification; and
3. the person or organization responsible for the modification.

The indication must not falsely imply that the original developers made or approved the modifications.

